  "infoAgreementValue": "The price written in your sale agreement: the quoted price plus any extras (such as parking) included in the agreement.",
  "infoStampDuty": "A state tax on the sale agreement, charged on the higher of the agreement value and the government ready reckoner value. In Mumbai it includes metro cess; women buyers get a 1% concession.",
  "infoRegistration": "Fee to register the agreement with the sub-registrar: 1% of the agreement value, capped at ₹30,000.",
  "infoGst": "Goods and services tax on under-construction flats only: 1% for affordable housing (carpet up to 60 m² and value up to ₹45 lakh), otherwise 5%. Ready flats with OC and resale flats pay no GST.",
  "infoBuilderExtrasOutsideAgreement": "Charges the builder collects separately from the agreement, such as clubhouse membership. No stamp duty, but you still pay them.",
  "infoCorpus": "A one-time contribution to the society's reserve fund, collected by the builder.",
  "infoAdvanceMaintenance": "Builders collect society maintenance in advance, usually 12–24 months, at possession.",
  "infoSocietyTransfer": "Fee the housing society charges to transfer membership and the share certificate to you.",
  "infoBrokerage": "The agent's commission, usually 1–2% of the price, plus 18% GST.",
  "infoRenovation": "A rough allowance for repairs, rising with the building's age.",
  "infoLoanProcessing": "One-time fee the bank charges to process the loan, plus 18% GST.",
  "infoMortgageStampDuty": "Stamp duty on the loan (mortgage) agreement, capped at ₹10,000 in Maharashtra.",
  "infoLegal": "Lawyer fees for title search and agreement review. Don't skip this.",
  "infoPreEmiInterest": "While the flat is being built, the bank releases the loan in stages and you pay interest on what has been released. We assume half the loan is out on average.",
  "infoRentOverlap": "Rent you keep paying until you can move in.",
  "infoInteriors": "Furniture, kitchen, painting and fittings. Change this to your own budget.",
  "flagNoReraTitle": "No MahaRERA number",
  "flagNoReraAction": "Every under-construction project must be registered with MahaRERA. Ask for the number and check it on the MahaRERA website before you pay anything.",
  "flagNoOcTitle": "No occupancy certificate",
  "flagNoOcAction": "Without an OC the building may be illegal; banks may refuse a loan and the society can't be formed properly. Ask for the OC from the municipal corporation.",
  "flagGstSlabEdgeTitle": "Just above the affordable GST limit",
  "flagGstSlabEdgeAction": "The agreement value is just over ₹45 lakh, so GST is 5% instead of 1%. Ask whether some extras can be left out of the agreement or the price adjusted.",
  "flagStampOnReadyReckonerTitle": "Stamp duty on ready reckoner value",
  "flagStampOnReadyReckonerAction": "The government value is higher than your agreement value, so stamp duty is charged on the higher amount. The difference may also have income-tax effects; ask a CA.",
  "flagVeryOldBuildingTitle": "Very old building",
  "flagVeryOldBuildingAction": "Buildings this old may need redevelopment soon; banks give short loans or none. Get a structural audit and ask about redevelopment plans.",
  "flagOldBuildingTitle": "Old building",
  "flagOldBuildingAction": "Expect higher repairs and shorter loan tenure. Ask for the latest structural audit.",
  "flagFundsShortfallTitle": "Not enough own funds",
  "flagFundsShortfallAction": "The cash you need is more than the own funds you entered. Look at a lower price, a bigger loan or a co-applicant.",
  "flagTenureCutByBuildingTitle": "Loan tenure cut by building age",
  "flagTenureCutByBuildingAction": "Banks won't lend beyond the building's remaining life, so the loan is shorter and smaller. Check with your bank before you commit.",
  "flagSellerLoanTitle": "Seller has a home loan",
  "flagSellerLoanAction": "Pay the seller's bank directly, collect the original documents and a loan closure letter before registration completes.",
  "flagHighLoadingTitle": "High loading",
  "flagHighLoadingAction": "Built-up area is much larger than carpet. Compare flats on carpet-area price, which is what RERA requires builders to quote.",
  "flagBelowMarketPriceTitle": "Price far below the area rate",
